  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Weight of the bowl<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>mg</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>V</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mtext>g</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>[</mo><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mtext>D</mtext><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mtext>d</mtext><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>]</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi><mtext>g</mtext></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> is the outer diameter, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></math> is the inner diameter and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#961;</mi></math> is the density of bowl.<br />Weight of the liquid displaced by the bowl<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext>=V</mtext><mo>'</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mtext>g</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mtext>D</mtext><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mtext>g</mtext></math>, where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi></math> is the density of the liquid.<br />For the flotation,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mtext>D</mtext><mtext>2</mtext></mfrac><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mtext>g</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>[</mo><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mtext>D</mtext><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mfrac><mtext>d</mtext><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>]</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mtext>g</mtext><mspace width=\"0.5em\"></mspace></math><br /><br />By solving we get <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>0.98</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>"
